(text "TCA9534 at 0x20; power-on pins are inputs with external pulldowns.\nMAX17049 at 0x36 senses the protected 2S pack; its VDD is regulated 3.3 V.\nMAIN_ENABLE is RP2040 GPIO23. POWER_REQUEST is the rear ON/OFF request." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2831937c-cdb3-4999-aeb4-0eacac85c388))
